        /// <br/>
        /// <br/>The edits to the issue's fields are defined using `update` and `fields`. The fields that can be edited are determined using [ Get edit issue metadata](#api-rest-api-3-issue-issueIdOrKey-editmeta-get).
        /// <br/>
        /// <br/>**Note:** This endpoint doesn't check screen configurations to determine if a field is editable. For more context, see the [Deprecation of override screen security](https://community.developer.atlassian.com/t/deprecation-of-override-screen-security/97153) announcement.
