        /// <param name="overrideScreenSecurity">Whether screen security is overridden to enable hidden fields to be edited. Available to Connect and Forge app users with *Administer Jira* [global permission](https://confluence.atlassian.com/x/x4dKLg) and Forge apps acting on behalf of users with *Administer Jira* [global permission](https://confluence.atlassian.com/x/x4dKLg).</param>
