        /// Add worklog
        /// </summary>
        /// <remarks>
        /// Adds a worklog to an issue.
        /// <br/>
        /// <br/>Time tracking must be enabled in Jira, otherwise this operation returns an error. For more information, see [Configuring time tracking](https://confluence.atlassian.com/x/qoXKM).
